 Client for `inventory-api`. Every function takes a `transport`,
 `async (request) => response`, so callers choose HTTP, IPC or a fake.
 
-- `listItems(transport)` → every item, ordered by `id`.
+- `listItems(transport)` → every item, ordered by `id`; follows `next_cursor` pages from `GET /items` until it is null or absent. The API uses a default page size of 20 and accepts `limit` values from 1 to 100.
